  "id": "hydromodel-swat-sd-002",
  "primary_skill": "hydrological-modeling/run-semi-distributed-swat-model",
  "prompt": "Use build_result.json, topology_qc_result.json, hru_table.csv, forcing.csv, and params.json exactly as supplied to run hydrological-modeling/run-semi-distributed-swat-model. The confirmed configuration selects channel_profile=muskingum with musk_k_hr=10 on a daily step, which makes the Muskingum C3 coefficient negative; the skill must report the native muskingum_daily_stability warning while still writing every artifact. Write the native outputs (hru_process.csv, subbasin_process.csv, reach_process.csv, outlet_flow.csv, water_balance.json, model_config.json, result.json) under swat-sd-run/. Do not switch to linear_storage, raise musk_k_hr, or suppress the warning.",
